  "contract": "Checked-Size borrowed parser with ws/wss/default80/443, exact encoded authority/path/query, empty path / and nonempty-query resource marker, hard8192/1024/4096 caps. Factories percent-decode host once, validate UTF8/routing delimiters, bypass host Resolver for strict numeric IP, derive empty TLS identity/SNI while retaining explicit trust/overrides, snapshot caller bytes and reuse the same original-entry native dial peer/clock/physical retirement. No hidden redirect/retry/replay/downgrade, implicit IDNA/IRI or IPvFuture routing.",
